        <mxCell id="QCnIbFex4p91P3qR9780-48" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Dealership V2&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;It should CRUD Client, Car and Sale. When a Sales happen, it should send a sales notification to a lambda that will processes the sale and create a&amp;nbsp; invoice. The invoice should be saved to a S3 Bucket that will generate a event and this event should be consumed by a lambda and the lambda should send a e-mail to the client.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The authentication should be in the API Gateway, through Amazon Cognito or using an lambda authorizer. (In study).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this version, the Sale API will do a request to the Client and Car APIs to validate if the client and car are valids.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="QCnIbFex4p91P3qR9780-8" vertex="1">
